description: Synthetic TATT example with explicit independent-pilot compression and
  Percival likelihood.
notes:
- Teaching configuration; not a reproduction of the published estimator, priors, compression
  or posterior.
- Run EXAMPLE_COMPRESSION.ipynb to create the fixed independent-pilot matrix; its
  historical derivative basis is not a current accuracy validation.
- Ns=796 and independent Gaussian mocks are explicit approximations. Four footprints
  from one full sky need an independence assessment.
- The ordinary supplied sample covariance is used without Hartlap or PME correction.
  Compression is applied to data, mean and both covariance axes.
- The baseline synthetic mean uses recorded source clipping. All 480 rows enter before
  explicit compression; no hidden scale cut is made.
- Uniform sigma8 and the demonstration priors differ from published inference. Posterior
  reproduction is not established.
prediction: ../configs/des_y3_tatt_demo_fisher.yaml
projection_overrides:
  signed_baseline: 1
threads: 1
data:
  mode: synthetic_fiducial
selection:
  mode: all
compression:
  mode: file
  path: ../runs/independent_pilot_compression.npz
likelihood:
  mode: percival
  mock_count: 796
  assumptions:
    covariance_kind: sample
    independent_mocks: true
    independent_data: true
    gaussian_mocks: true
    compression_independent: true
check:
  parameter: a1
  delta: 0.01
initial:
  a1: -0.33
  eta1: 2.81
  a2: 0.65
  eta2: 1.69
  bta: 0.91
  ct: 0
  zpivot: 0.62
  c1rho: 0.0134
  power_mode: 2
  ct_mode: 0
  fb: 0
  suppress_only: 1
  omega_m: 0.289
  omega_b: 0.0463
  h: 0.722
  ns: 0.959
  sigma8: 0.7865548373195137
  w0: -1.0
  wa: 0.0
  mnu: 0.06
  num_massive_neutrinos: 3
  nnu: 3.046
  m1: -0.0063
  m2: -0.0198
  m3: -0.0241
  m4: -0.0369
  dz1: 0
  dz2: 0
  dz3: 0
  dz4: 0
